 "offset_seconds": 8.379999999999566,
 "words_heard": 285,
 "words": 285,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I was the younger son and I wanted it all now",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 11.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Said, Father, give me my share, I'm through behind this plow",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 12.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He divided up his property, I gathered everything",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 12.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I left for a distant country where the money made me king",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 12.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the money ran like water and the famine came to town",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 12.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I was feeding pigs for strangers with my head hung down",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 12.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I longed to eat the pods they ate, but no one gave me a crumb",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 12.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I came to myself and I thought of where I'd come from",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 12.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will get up and go to my father",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 13.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am no longer worthy to be called your son",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 12.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Treat me as one of your hired hands",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 12.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "While I was still a long way off",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 12.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My father saw me on the road",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 12.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He ran to me and held me tight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 12.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He kissed me and he brought me home",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 12.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This son of mine was dead and is alive again",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 12.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He was lost and is found",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 13.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My brother heard the music as he came in from the field",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 13.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He stood outside in anger and his heart would not yield",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 13.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So our father came outside to him and pleaded with him there",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 13.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My child, you're always with me, all I have is yours to share",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 13.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We had to celebrate and rejoice",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 13.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Because this brother of yours was dead and is alive",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 14.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He was lost and is found",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 14.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "While I was still a long way off",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 14.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My father saw me on the road",
   "heard": 7,
